The APK preparation and signing implementation includes code from
LemonLoader/MelonLoaderInstaller, commit ac443fce9f2ef890caddf8c64bba9194a43361bd.
The upstream license and author notices apply to that code. The vendored copy retains the AXML and V2 signing utilities used by the Android
manager. The old installer pipeline, unused V1 signer and shared fallback
signing key are omitted. The manager generates and validates a private key
for each installation; invalid saved keys stop preparation.
The retained signer requires complete stream reads and validates loaded key material.
Source: https://github.com/LemonLoader/MelonLoaderInstaller
